{"html":"\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page-inner flex flex-col justify-between\">\n    \u003cheader class=\"mast\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"brand\">\n        \u003cstrong>AlpacaNotes\u003c/strong>\n        \u003cspan class=\"kicker\">PART 03 · 证明拓扑与在野分布\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"masttime font-mono text-xs\">\n        \u003cspan>PROPOSITION 3.1 · 并列维度 · PAGE 09 / 20\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"pb-2.5 border-b-2 border-ink dark:border-neutral-700\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"ed-page-title font-serif text-[34px] font-black text-ink dark:text-white leading-tight\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-accent font-mono mr-3\">[3.1]\u003c/span>证明空间几何拓扑\n      \u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 pl-3.5 border-l-4 border-accent mt-2\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">核心论断\u003c/span>\n        \u003cp class=\"ed-thesis-text font-serif text-[21px] text-ink dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          累积演化在分支图上诱导内在度规流形，证明是流形中的测地子图。\n        \u003c/p>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-main ed-layout-pillars-4 grid grid-cols-4 gap-5 my-auto h-[600px] items-stretch\">\n      \n    \u003cdiv class=\"card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#1b4f72;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#1b4f7214; color:#1b4f72;\">§ 01\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold\">DIMENSION 01\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n          分支度规诱导\n        \u003c/h3>\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">超高密度邻接\u003c/strong>：累积重写在超曲面投射分支图，构筑内在度规。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">离散几何流形\u003c/strong>：抽象命题事件织就具有可测距离的拓扑流形。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M50 85 Q140 20 230 85 M65 55 Q140 15 215 55 M90 95 L110 35 M140 95 L140 28 M190 95 L170 35\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-opacity=\"0.7\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"140\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\">分支度规流形\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">图解\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>命题邻接关系编织出可测距的流形。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0284c7;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#0284c714; color:#0284c7;\">§ 02\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold\">DIMENSION 02\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n          蕴涵锥测地线\n        \u003c/h3>\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">因果子图流动\u003c/strong>：证明即蕴涵锥中连接公理与目标的有向事件流。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">搜索策略分野\u003c/strong>：自动证明与极小构造对应几何空间中相异路径。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpolygon points=\"140,20 55,95 225,95\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M140 20 L140 95\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M140 20 Q180 55 140 95\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"140\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0284c7\">直线 = 极小测地证明\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#0284c716; color:#0284c7;\">图解\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>自动证明器搜寻蕴涵锥最短路径。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#b45309;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#b4530914; color:#b45309;\">§ 03\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold\">DIMENSION 03\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n          消切与证明折叠\n        \u003c/h3>\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">引理高维折叠\u003c/strong>：持续复用中间引理可将庞大推导折叠为紧凑图。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">消切指数膨胀\u003c/strong>：展开为纯公理链会引发步长与体积超指数暴涨。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003crect x=\"35\" y=\"25\" width=\"70\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d97706\" fill-opacity=\"0.15\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d97706\">折叠 DAG\u003c/text>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M112 41 L142 41\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M150 41 L175 20 L205 60 L235 20 L255 60\" stroke=\"#e11d48\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"200\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#e11d48\">消切展开指数伸长\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#b4530916; color:#b45309;\">对比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>不用引理直接消切展开，体积暴涨。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card border-t-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#0f766e;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#0f766e14; color:#0f766e;\">§ 04\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold\">DIMENSION 04\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n          微观碰撞与流体\n        \u003c/h3>\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">布朗运动轨迹\u003c/strong>：机器搜索的离散转向对偶于稀薄气体分子碰撞。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">连续粗粒抽象\u003c/strong>：人类高阶概念是对该空间施加的宏观流体感知。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 280 120\" class=\"w-full h-[115px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M35 80 L55 30 L85 75 L105 25 L125 65\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M160 65 Q205 25 250 65\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"80\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#64748b\">微观布朗碰撞\u003c/text>\n          \u003ctext x=\"205\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0d9488\">宏观流体平滑\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#0f766e16; color:#0f766e;\">类比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>机器搜索如布朗碰撞，人类如流体。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-bottom-bar pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-wrap flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-md max-w-5xl\">\n        \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 text-base shrink-0\">\u003c/i>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-text text-[20px] leading-tight text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 font-sans\">\n          \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">本节要旨：\u003c/strong>\u003cspan>数学证明非偶然符号拼凑，而是因果流形约束下的测地线流动。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"folio font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 shrink-0\">\n        \u003cspan>Stephen Wolfram · The Physicalization of Metamathematics\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n"}